id: pm-slack-standup-jti0
title: Use the pm SDK for certified standup reads and lifecycle roles
description: "Replace the 2026-10-25 audit findings with host-bound complete reads, configured SDK lifecycle roles and SDK expected errors. Preserve certification and integrity, prove public-tracker differential parity and behavioural reverts, retain the explicitly selected synchronous CLI adapter for compatibility."
type: Chore
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[3]: "gh:unbraind/pm-slack-standup#151",refactor,sdk-adoption
