updated_at: "2026-10-26T03:19:45.221Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-26T03:19:32.299Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-25T22:19:19.000Z"
author: codex-agent
resolution: "Delivered by PR #151, merge d1279e294c3bf41694927fd1636e2a02425a9f9a, merged 2026-10-25T22:19:19Z. index.ts reads host listAllComplete with full bodies and fresh verified history; status-roles.ts classifyStandupItem centralizes SDK roles/aliases for reports, decisions and blockers. test/sdk-adoption.test.ts and test/status-roles.test.ts cover no-executable reads, expected errors, cache corruption, multiple active/default-open names, terminal decisions and the reviewing regression."
expected_result: "Standups use certified host SDK reads, configured lifecycle roles and expected errors without losing integrity or explicit synchronous compatibility."
actual_result: The linked SDK/role suite passes on main. Inspected all lifecycle consumers use the shared classifier; 64-registry property cases and real reviewing command/export regressions are retained. The explicitly selected synchronous CLI adapter remains supported.
